  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:238px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Mutant_Ranged_Spitter.jpg\" title=\"Cinder Ranged Spitter\"><img alt=\"Cinder Ranged Spitter\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"204\" src=\"/images/Monster-_Mutant_Ranged_Spitter.jpg\" width=\"236\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Mutant_Ranged_Spitter.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Cinder Ranged Spitter</div></div></div>\n<p>Although they are very similar in appearance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Melee_Whomper\" title=\"Mutant Melee Whomper\">Mutant Melee Whomper</a> they have a very different style of attack. \n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranged\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cinder Ranged Spitter\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Tip:</b> <i>Because they stand still and fire, they are very vulnerable to attacks such as <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Gosh\" title=\"Ray of Gosh\">Ray of Gosh</a>.</i>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
